  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066591)\n\nKim Woon-nam doesn't do well watching scary movies, but his friend Ji Myungsoo is always convincing him to go anyway.\n\nAfter watching a scary movie at the cinema with Myungsoo, Woon-nam begins suffering from sleep paralysis. Every night, a ghost molests him, leaving him exhausted from lack of sleep and dreading the moment he closes his eyes.\n\nThinking the ghost won't follow him, Woon-nam accepts Myungsoo's invitation to spend the night drinking at his place.\n\nHe's wrong.\n\nThe sleep paralysis happens again—but this time, the ghost has Ji Myungsoo's face.\n\nWhy does the dream feel so real? And why does it feel so good?",
